# Microsoft 365 MFA & Authentication Administration

## Overview

This lab focused on understanding and administering Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) in Microsoft Entra ID.

The practical exercise simulated a real helpdesk incident where a user lost access to their Microsoft Authenticator device.

---

## Objectives

- Understand Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA)
- Understand authentication vs authorization
- Register Microsoft Authenticator
- Understand Temporary Access Pass (TAP)
- Create a TAP as an administrator
- Remove a user's lost authentication method
- Recover a user's MFA access
- Register a replacement authentication device
- Verify authentication methods in Microsoft Entra ID
- Investigate authentication changes using Audit Logs

