# Practical Exercise 2 — Simulate a Lost Phone

The lab simulated the following helpdesk incident:

> "I lost my phone and I can no longer approve Microsoft Authenticator sign-in requests."

### Administrator actions

1. Opened Bob John in Microsoft Entra.
2. Opened Authentication methods.
3. Identified the existing Microsoft Authenticator method.
4. Removed the lost device's authentication method.
5. Confirmed that Bob no longer had a usable Authenticator method.
6. Created a Temporary Access Pass.

